# STYLE_TITLE — portable style prompt

Copy-paste blocks for using this style outside this library: another coding agent, p5/Canvas, After Effects notes, an image or video generator. Each block stands alone. Replace the topic line with whatever the clip is about; the look and motion rules are the style.

## A. Full brief

```
Make this in the "STYLE_TITLE" style: TAGLINE

LOOK
- TODO: the material, its surface, its edge, how shading is built (one line per rule).
- Primitives only: TODO. Orthographic, chunky, legible at phone size.
- Backgrounds: TODO. Saturated colour only on TODO.

LAYOUT (CANVAS)
- Top mark: TODO (position, size, content).
- Stage: TODO. Captions: TODO. Keep the bottom 20% empty for platform UI.
- Zones measured from the reference: content box TODO; text bands TODO.

TYPE
- Display: TODO (family, weight, case, size band).
- Caption: TODO. Label: TODO.

MOTION
- TODO: what is rigid, what pops, what drifts.
- Camera: TODO.
- Ambient: TODO, always running.
- Event density: TODO per second, landing on stressed words.

STORY
- TODO: the beat spine this style suits, in 6 lines.
```

